#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:5
msgid "Open Project"
msgstr "打开项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:7
msgid ""
"Opening a `project`_ saved somewhere from the computer Hard Disk or local "
"server can be done from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_ and using the corresponding "
"keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"打开保存在计算机硬盘或本地服务器上某处的 `项目 <project_>`_ ，可以通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 、 `工具栏 "
"<toolbar_>`_ 以及相应的键盘快捷键来完成。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:10
msgid ""
"A `project`_ is conformed by a single file with ``.qet`` format. The "
"``.qet`` extension is the native extension from QElectroTech. Even so, "
"QElectroTech allows also working with Extensible Markup Language files, "
"files with extension ``.xml``."
msgstr ""
"一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 由单个 ``.qet`` 格式的文件构成。 ``.qet`` 是 QElectroTech "
"的原生扩展名。不过，QElectroTech 也支持处理可扩展标记语言（Extensible Markup Language）文件，即扩展名为 "
"``.xml`` 的文件。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:15
msgid "Open project from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏打开项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:17
msgid "Select **File > Open** menu item to open the search file PopUP window."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 打开** 菜单项以打开搜索文件弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:22
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech file menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文件菜单"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:24
msgid "Search the `project`_ in the computer"
msgstr "在计算机中搜索 `项目 <project_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:25
#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:32
#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:47
msgid ""
"Press **Open** button to close the search file PopUP window and open the "
"`project`_."
msgstr "按 **打开** 按钮关闭搜索文件弹出窗口并打开 `项目 <project_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:28
msgid "Open project from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏打开项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:30
msgid ""
"Select the icon |project| from `toolbar`_ to open the search file PopUP "
"window."
msgstr "在 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择图标 |project| 以打开搜索文件弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:34
msgid "project"
msgstr "项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:31
#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:46
msgid "Search the `project`_ at the computer"
msgstr "在计算机上搜索 `项目 <project_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:38
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**"
msgstr "如果未显示 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ ，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 中将其显示。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:41
msgid "Open project using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键打开项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:43
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:45
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + o`` to open the search file PopUP window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + o`` 打开搜索文件弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:51
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:54
msgid "Files history"
msgstr "文件历史"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:56
msgid ""
"When QElectroTech has already been used, exists the possibility to open a "
"`project`_ created, opened and/or saved previously. **File History** has "
"been integrated."
msgstr ""
"如果之前使用过 QElectroTech，就可以打开此前创建、打开和/或保存过的 `项目 <project_>`_ 。此功能已集成在 **File "
"History** 中。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:59
msgid ""
"Select **File > Latest files** menu item to display the file history from "
"QElectroTech."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 最新文件** 菜单项以显示 QElectroTech 的文件历史。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:60
msgid "Click on the `project`_ file that should be opened."
msgstr "点击要打开的 `项目 <project_>`_ 文件。"

#: ../../source/users/project/open_project.rst:65
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech File History"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文件历史"
